text = "In 1957 Cleveland police officers forced their way into Dollree Mapp's house thinking she was housing a fugitive. 

They did not find the fugitive, but they found pornography which was illegal under Ohio anti-obscenity laws. The police were unable to provide a valid search warrant. Mapp argued that the search was unconstitutional."
horizontal_alignment = 1
